WEBVTT

00:01:27.598 --> 00:01:30.130
But did I lose any sleep over his message?

00:01:31.205 --> 00:01:32.355
No.

00:01:32.748 --> 00:01:38.579
I wasn't ready to let a political stunt
interfere with my beauty sleep.

00:01:38.952 --> 00:01:40.722
(Laughter)

00:01:40.746 --> 00:01:42.428
Now fast-forward 10 years.

00:01:43.865 --> 00:01:46.386
In February this year,

00:01:46.410 --> 00:01:48.690
I saw this report.

00:01:50.163 --> 00:01:54.154
This here report basically concludes

00:01:54.178 --> 00:02:00.332
that one-third of the ice
on the Hindu Kush Himalaya mountains